 "description": "Welcome to WhatIForaa! 🎬\n\nEver wondered what would happen if… your crush became your tutor? You got stranded on a cruise ship for 30 days? You spent a night locked in a waterpark? \n\nOn this channel we take one simple \"What if…\" question and turn it into an animated story full of romance, drama, survival and mystery, with twists you won't see coming. 💘🌊😱\n\nEvery story stars our hero and Maya, two characters who keep ending up in the craziest situations together. Will they survive? Will they finally confess their feelings? You'll have to watch till the very end to find out!\n\n✨ What you'll find here:\n• \"What If\" animated stories\n• Romance, crushes and first love\n• Survival challenges: 30 days in impossible places\n• Mystery, suspense and plot twists\n• Funny, emotional and sometimes creepy endings\n\n🔔 Subscribe and turn on notifications so you never miss a new story!\n💬 Tell us in the comments what \"What If\" story you want to see next. Your idea could become our next video!\n",
